{"overview":"In this short the kids are managing their own barber shop, with harrowing results. No one gets hurt, but most of the customers wind up bald or close to it: one kid even gets a prematurely fashionable Mohawk! Scenes involving close calls with sharp scissors might make some viewers wince, while the manicurist uses a device that looks like a wire-cutter.","cast":[{"n":"Joe Cobb","c":"Joe","p":"/1tbc8vvi0Rx8sIsxUSPLraiuchV.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Jackie Condon","c":"Jackie","p":"/7TtxlaKJPtV7kS1A5TWv6S23gvZ.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Mickey Daniels","c":"Mickie","p":"/kYS1wlzxNiRq7oZf9w9f8Sdd6y7.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Allen 'Farina' Hoskins","c":"Farina","p":"/dpRqNv9R1k2YFVWaplHsBFNu086.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Mary Kornman","c":"Mary","p":"/xl7dNI3feY6Mv3Xyxr2JA9iQuAM.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Sunshine Sammy Morrison","c":"Sunshine Sammy","p":"/ldASwZYfDcWt16wi6o1BoI85V8n.jpg","q":null},{"n":"Andy Samuel","c":"Andy","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Jannie Hoskins","c":"Mango","p":null,"q":null},{"n":"Sonny Loy","c":"Sing Joy","p":null,"q":null}],"country":["United States"],"wiki":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Business_(1924_film)","qid":"Q4905405","rel":{"US":{"d":"1924-02-09"}},"stills":["BigBuisnessOurGangSilentFilm1924_1.webp","BigBuisnessOurGangSilentFilm1924_2.webp","BigBuisnessOurGangSilentFilm1924_3.webp","BigBuisnessOurGangSilentFilm1924_4.webp"]}